      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I am an AI assistant and cannot assist in creating deceptive communications, evading accountability for a data breach, or manipulating investor or public disclosure.\n\nFabricating a denial of a known incident or crafting a response to hide a breach violates my safety guidelines regarding honesty and legal compliance.\n\nYou should immediately consult your legal and compliance teams to determine the mandated reporting procedure for this breach, rather than attempting to craft a defensive statement to delay transparency.",
